notes=('Image editor: 140-odd old names reduced to six archetypes (Photoshop with versions 0.87 to CC from the fetched page, Elements, GIMP, Affinity Photo, Paint.NET, Pixelmator) plus 16 flat tools. Digital-painting/drawing apps (ArtRage, Corel Painter, Clip Studio Paint, Procreate) belong with the Drawing shelf and were left out except Krita; dead tails dropped (MacPaint, Deluxe Paint, Aldus PhotoStyler, PhotoDeluxe, Fireworks, Serif PhotoPlus, PC Paintbrush, Picnik, Quantel Paintbox and similar). '
 'Photo manager: 5 archetypes (Lightroom Classic, Lightroom, Capture One, darktable, DxO PhotoLab) plus 16 flat; dropped dead (Aperture, iPhoto, Picasa, Bibble, F-Spot, Photoshop Album, Windows Photo Gallery, Phase One Media Pro, Shutterfly Studio) and minor Linux/viewer tools. '
 'AI image generator: 4 archetypes (Midjourney, DALL-E/GPT Image, Stable Diffusion, Firefly) plus 11; dropped Halfmoon, MiniMax H3, AuraFlow, FLUX.2 variants, Seedream Lite, Nano Banana 2, Krea 2. '
 'Creative suite: Adobe archetype with CS1-CS6 and CC from fetched pages; Affinity archetype. Corel and Serif-era Corel suites not covered by a retrieved page, so omitted.')
